4
00:00:07.204 --> 00:00:08.463
About this glossary.

5
00:00:08.743 --> 00:00:16.999
This glossary has 189 core terms, each with a one-line definition and a link to the chapter that explains it in depth.

6
00:00:17.279 --> 00:00:18.793
It is checked against the book.

7
00:00:19.073 --> 00:00:26.497
GlossaryGen (in labs or appendix-tools/) verifies that every term actually appears in the chapter it links to.

8
00:00:26.777 --> 00:00:31.556
Hyphens and spaces count as the same, and there are optional exact-match probes.

9
00:00:31.836 --> 00:00:50.673
On the first run, 15 of 159 terms failed: some pointed to the wrong chapter (anycast is covered in Ch 08, not Ch 03; backpressure in Ch 19, not Ch 18);. some were phrased differently from the chapter (outbox pattern versus outbox);.

10
